        "descriptions": [
            {
                "value": "A comprehensive multimodal dataset of greenhouse-grown sugar beets. Data was collected automatically between August 12, 2025 and September 22, 2025. The dataset follows the plants from seeding to a predetermined growth stage and contains hyperspectral, thermal, RGB, and depth imagery of the plants during this period, with dry stress induced in 2/3 of the plants on September 3, 2025. Environmental data and metadata are also provided. The data subcollections for each modality can be accessed at the links below. \n<br>\n<br>\nNote that the current version of the public dataset temporarily contains only the data relevant to review of the associated conference paper, with a subsequent full dataset release pending publication.<br>\n<br>\nHyperspectral Data - <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/PK9YDR\">https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/PK9YDR</a><br>\n\nThermal Data - <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/ASL0BV\">https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/ASL0BV</a><br>\n\nRGB Data - <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/FGLG94\">https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/FGLG94</a><br>\n\nDepth Data - <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/SMHP1Y\">https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/SMHP1Y</a><br>\n\nEnvironmental & Metadata - <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/C0HOBN\">https://doi.org/10.26249/FK2/C0HOBN</a>\n\n<br>\n<br>\nThis work was supported by the Lower Saxony Ministry of Science and Culture (MWK), funded through the zukunft.niedersachsen program of the Volkswagen Foundation, as part of two projects (ZN4219 - HybrInt and ZN4661 - RLA). We also thank the agrifood-TEF-DE project for additional hardware support.",
